Subject: [PATCH 1/4] SDXL LoRA: keep MFA but disable neural accelerators; add
 training diagnostics

- Trainer: force .disableMFANeuralAccelerators for SD/SDXL (M5 MFA attention
  backward produces non-finite gradients via the NA path)
- Trainer: DRAWLORA_LOSS_SCALE / DRAWLORA_GRAD_NAN / DRAWLORA_NO_SCALER hooks,
  scaler skip counter, optimizer parameter count diagnostics
- NNC: expose Parameters.gradientIsNaN for per-parameter gradient checks
- Package.swift: vendor swift-png and swift-protobuf as path dependencies
