Subject: [PATCH 2/4] diag: per-parameter NaN dump, attention-level hook,
 ENABLE_MFA clears NAX

- DRAWLORA_GRAD_NAN_ALL prints name+isnan for every lora_up parameter
- DRAWLORA_ATTN_LEVEL selects none/scale1/quantized for the SDXL builder
- DRAWLORA_ENABLE_MFA now also clears .disableMFANeuralAccelerators (it previously
  only cleared .disableMFA, which made 'NAX on' runs silently run with NAX off)
